{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_06",
  "title": "紧追猛赶",
  "storyCode": "DH-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c3ec287289d63e06542622289d0ae0e00a1e1132bc057a0a57ddc41f23d5a600",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "水月选手在放弃了阻拦伏兵后，来到将陈林两位选手掩埋的武器店废墟之上，停留了一会儿后便不知所踪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们所有的摄像头和无人机都没有找到他的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而第一梯队中，甜蜜夏日队，已经最先抵达游泳检查点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "第一梯队的其他队伍也陆续穿过了游泳检查点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而我们最关心的鼠胆龙威队中，埃内斯托小弟为了殿后已经被打倒，我们的工作人员判断他已经失去战斗能力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "陈林两位女侠此时却依然没有动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "难道真的万事休矣了吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老陈，你不是吧，你不会倒在这种地方的对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "星熊小姐对比赛很上心呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哪里，她绝对是给陈押了大注，才在那念叨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "认识这么久了，这种比赛的输赢，谁在乎啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "输了又不代表就怎么了，赢了也不能证明什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我倒是希望她输了，这样我才好嘲笑她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎，艾雅法拉，来，我来给你试试这款面霜，我觉得一定适合你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然，又一声轰鸣，从停留在埃内斯托武器店的镜头屏幕中传来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "等等，这难道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "屏幕中，硝烟散去，而从硝烟中走出来的，正是推着自行车的陈和林雨霞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来了来了，终于来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "陈女侠与林女侠又一次地站上了比赛的舞台！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，两人只剩下一辆车，位置距离游泳检查点还有一小段距离，而此时第一梯队已经开始了游泳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鼠胆龙威真的还有机会吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你先走，我用跑的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "上车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "别让我再说一次，上车。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你确定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我来骑，你来解决碍事的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "太令人感动了，虽然只剩下一辆车，但是林女侠并没有抛弃陈女侠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她让陈女侠站上自己的车后座，由她来骑车，而陈女侠负责对付那些想要妨碍她们的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "两个人，一辆自行车，一次让所有人都目瞪口呆的完美配合！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "现在我敢说，她们两个的组合，是这场大奖赛中最强大的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你压到我头发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "敌人在前面，我也没办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你能不能不要乱扭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要不然你来骑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陈忽地压下林雨霞的头，躲开了迎面而来的一个轮胎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "林雨霞却猛地抬头，狠狠撞在陈的脸上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "林雨霞，你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "鼠胆龙威队，飞快地突破了最后一段跑道，进入了沙滩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "游泳检查点就在她们的眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但是，其他队伍显然不会那么轻易地让她们通过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "D.D.D.",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "一场沙滩上的恶战，即将爆发！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
